	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "VQFN-20 3.5x4.5 mm, 0.5 mm pitch, wettable flanks, TI RGY0020B (also RGY0020E, same land pattern): TI LM5146-Q1 datasheet SNVSB32B p.58-60 (https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/lm5146-q1.pdf#page=58), used for the LM5146RGYR (SNVSBV0A has only the generic RGY view). Copy of KiCad Package_DFN_QFN:Texas_RGY_R-PVQFN-N20_EP2.05x3.05mm_ThermalVias (RGY0020A) with the TI land pattern: EP 1.7x2.7 mm, pads 0.6x0.25 mm R0.05 at x +/-1.65 and y +/-2.15 (pins 1, 10, 11, 20 at x +/-0.75); EP paste 4 x 0.75x1.21 mm at (+/-0.475, +/-0.71), 79 % of the EP (TI 80 %, 0.125 mm stencil); thermal vias at TI locations (+/-0.6, 0) and (0, +/-1.1), 0.3 mm drill (LM5146 datasheet 11.1), to be filled, plugged or tented; non solder mask defined, mask expansion 0.07 mm max. 3D model: KiCad RGY0020A (EP drawn 2.05x3.05).")
	(tags "QFN NoLead VQFN RGY0020B wettable flanks LM5146 thermal vias")
